description:
Request for a comprehensive pedestrian safety and ADA accessibility assessment at the intersection of Merrydale Road and North San Pedro Road in San Rafael, CA. 

Requested Actions:
1.	A formal pedestrian safety and traffic engineering assessment within a 500-ft radius of this intersection;
2.	A written response identifying the assigned staff contact, timeline for review, and planned or proposed improvements;
3.	Access to any existing traffic studies, collision data, or Vision Zero analyses for this corridor; and
4.	Implementation of interim safety measures (enhanced signage, markings, or temporary beacons) pending a full redesign.
